; Klatt's duration rules 5 to 7. Six cards a segment in (kind, wf, after, bef, s, nextk); out three factors in
; hundredths, one a rule in turn, 100 where a rule doesn't apply, then 0, the end of the list rules2 starts. Rule 5:
; a vowel in a word with more vowels (bef or after) 80. Rule 6: a consonant not first in its word (wf 0) 85. Rule 7,
; for a segment not stressed 1: a vowel 50 if vowels of its word come before and after it, else 70; a sonorant
; before a vowel 10; anything else 70. A pause (kind 8) has none of them.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-16: a segment; a pause: three 100s
  04                    INP   wf
  05                    INP   after
  06                    INP   bef
  07                    INP   s
  08                    INP   nextk
  09                    CLA   c100
  10                    STO   f
  11                    CLA   kind
  12                    SUB   c8
  13                    TAC   sound
  14                    OUT   f
  15                    OUT   f
  16                    JMP   pad
  17            sound   CLA   kind     17-35: rule 5 for a vowel, rule 6 for a consonant
  18                    SUB   n2
  19                    TAC   syl
  20                    OUT   c100
  21                    CLA   wf
  22                    SUB   00
  23                    TAC   o85
  24                    OUT   c100
  25                    JMP   r7
  26            o85     OUT   c85
  27                    JMP   r7
  28            syl     CLA   bef
  29                    ADD   after
  30                    SUB   00
  31                    TAC   v100
  32                    OUT   c80
  33                    JMP   v6
  34            v100    OUT   c100
  35            v6      OUT   c100
  36            r7      CLA   s        36-66: rule 7, then 0
  37                    SUB   00
  38                    TAC   sev
  39                    SUB   00
  40                    TAC   pad
  41            sev     CLA   c70
  42                    STO   f
  43                    CLA   kind
  44                    SUB   n2
  45                    TAC   r7v
  46                    SUB   00
  47                    TAC   r7s
  48                    JMP   pad
  49            r7s     CLA   nextk
  50                    SUB   00
  51                    TAC   pad
  52                    SUB   00
  53                    TAC   ten
  54                    JMP   pad
  55            ten     CLA   c10
  56                    STO   f
  57                    JMP   pad
  58            r7v     CLA   bef
  59                    ADD   after
  60                    SUB   n2
  61                    TAC   pad
  62                    CLA   c50
  63                    STO   f
  64            pad     OUT   f
  65                    OUT   z
  66                    JMP   rec
  70            kind    DATA  0
  71            wf      DATA  0
  72            after   DATA  0
  73            bef     DATA  0
  74            s       DATA  0
  75            nextk   DATA  0
  76            f       DATA  0
  77            z       DATA  0
  78            c8      DATA  8
  79            n2      DATA  2
  80            c100    DATA  100
  81            c85     DATA  85
  82            c80     DATA  80
  83            c70     DATA  70
  84            c50     DATA  50
  85            c10     DATA  10
